at breathe an  atmosphere similar to that of earth  but with a very high level of  technological advancement in their  civilization the predators talk and kill  their prey using a combination of highly  advanced technology such as active  camouflage and energy weapons combined  with primitive weapons such as blades  spears and nets  they are nearly impossible to kill by  humans and even hunt swamps of  xenomorphs for fun  number 7 the newborn from the alien  resurrection movie after the predator we  will now showcase one of the xenomorphs  although not the typical drone or queen  this entry is a human  xenomorph hybrid and is very well  humanoid in appearance it appeared to be  around twice as large as a standard  warrior and substantially stronger while  the newborn still possessed an elongated  skull it was far shorter and more human  in shape even its face looks like  slash human slash skull slash monster  even though it was still a baby at that  time it was able to tear off the head of  a queen xenomorph with a single swipe of  its hand imagine the power it will have  when it's all grown up  number 6 symbiotes from the venom movies  the symbiotes are a species of inorganic  amorphous symbiotic extraterrestrials  created from the living abyss  at the beginning of the universe by the  primordial deity the dark god called  null  these deadly parasites can fuse with  host creatures and merge with them and  these merged entities if compatible  would have extraordinary powers their  strength would be multiplied over many  times and would be highly resistant to  almost any type of weapons aside from  sonic and flamethrowers the best  examples of these symbiotes are venom  riot and carnage from the recent movies  and they are definitely more powerful  than the others we have just mentioned  before  number 5 sauron from the hobbit and the  law of the rings movies  this being is the main antagonist of the  free people of  middle earth for most of its history in  tolkien's works and definitely the only  dark lord during the events of the  hobbit and the lord of the rings he is a  corrupt admirer a being of immense power  can like angels sauron was also a shape  changer taking in one instance the form  of a serpent a vampire a great wolf but  in most cases a tall humanoid creature  clad in black armor  he has power over many things and his  magic is near unmatched he is the true  lord of the one ring and could only be  killed by the destruction of that  particular ring in mount doom number  four hellboy from the hellboy movies  also known as  rama and originally an offspring of the  fallen angel azil and a witch  meant to rule over the earth and bring  forth the fires of hell into this plane  of existence hellboy was instead adopted  from an early age by the bureau of  paranormal research and defense he grew  up fighting on the side of humans  against monsters and even though in his  normal form he is still way more  powerful than the strongest human ever  that is still not the true nature of his  being in his demonic form he is  absolutely hell incarnate he can change  his size to kaiju's scale control  lightning manipulate hellfire and fly  after sprouting draconic wings he is  indeed a powerhouse  number three thanos from the marvel  cinematic universe  definitely on the top three thanos is a  member of a race of aliens known as the  titans and is the most feared warlord of  the universe although in some theories  he isn't eternal  he is tall bulky and purple in color has  extreme endurance durability and a very  high intellect he is so powerful that he  could overpower the likes of captain  america with mjolnir thor with  stormbreaker and ironman in his nanotech  suit all at once he is definitely  stronger than even the hulk and could go  toe-to-toe with even captain marvel  without the infinity stones he is on the  third spot but with the six stones he  would definitely be number one  number two dark side from the dc justice  league movie seen in the zack snyder cut  of the justice league that was  re-released in 2021 darkseid is  definitely one to be feared once known  as auxas he is an ancient and  all-powerful cosmic new god warlord and  a conqueror who reigns over the fiery  extra-dimensional planet called  apocalypse and desires to rule earth and  the entire multiverse by harnessing the  unimaginable power of the anti-life  equation in his younger days he was  defeated by earth's forces which  included the old gods and a green  lantern but in the present time he was  in a league of his own another level  above steffenwolf a general of his army  who gave the justice league a run for  their money  and number 1 dr manhattan from the movie  the watchmen he was originally a human  but was transformed into a god-like  entity by an experiment gone wrong he is  shown to be absolutely powerful and  invulnerable to all harm even when his  body is disintegrated he can reconstruct  it in a matter of seconds  dr manhattan has complete awareness and  control over atomic and subatomic  particles and can even see neutrinos you  know light things something in physics  he is omni-kinetic which means that he  can do almost anything  he can teleport himself over cosmic  distances at will and perceives time in  a different way seeing the past present  and future  all at once he is indeed the most  powerful on this list  anyway with that we come to the end of  it so do hit that like button for  support and subscribe as well to be a  part of the mind cue family but most of  all smash that bell icon for regular  updates on new videos right here on this  channel till the next one take care fam  [Music]

